================================================================================
THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS
================================================================================

The robotframework-odoofx package contains no third-party code. It depends on
the following projects, installed from PyPI under their own licenses:

1. Robot Framework
   - Project: https://robotframework.org/
   - License: Apache License 2.0
   - Used for: keyword library API, typed secrets, test execution

2. Requests
   - Project: https://requests.readthedocs.io/
   - License: Apache License 2.0
   - Used for: the JSON-2 channel (Odoo 19 and later)

3. Robot Framework Browser library (optional, `web` extra)
   - Project: https://github.com/MarketSquare/robotframework-browser
   - License: Apache License 2.0
   - Used for: the web channel, through Playwright
     (https://playwright.dev/, Apache License 2.0)

================================================================================
DESIGN LINEAGE
================================================================================

The method around the library (spec-driven test agents, guards) follows
rf-test-agents (https://github.com/CyrilM29/rf-test-agents, Apache License
2.0, same author). No code of it is part of this package.

